<form autocomplete="off"><h1>{{actor.name}}</h1>{{#if gate.template}}<p>Summon Rashoumon through Kuchiyose → Summon Creature → Rashoumon. The summoner must own the purchased aptitude and meet its attribute requirement. Dragging a compendium template does not pay chakra or validate prerequisites.</p>{{else}}<p>Rashoumon aptitude level {{gate.rank}} · {{gate.action}} action</p><p><strong>Wall size:</strong> {{gate.widthMeters}} m wide × {{gate.heightMeters}} m high.</p><p><strong>Hardness per gate:</strong> {{gate.hardness}}. Total for this casting: {{gate.totalHardness}} divided by {{gate.quantity}} gates.</p><label>Remaining Hardness <input type="number" min="0" step="any" name="flags.shinobi-no-sho-revamp.rashoumonGate.remainingHardness" value="{{gate.remainingHardness}}"></label>{{#if gate.nonDegrading}}<p>Level 3: insufficient damage is ignored; it does not reduce Hardness.</p>{{/if}}<p>Range {{gate.rangeMeters}} m · Casting cost {{gate.chakra}} Chakra.</p><p>Defense uses Magic Level +2. Cannot defend against an adjacent attacker. Resolve defense and damage manually; excess damage passes through a destroyed gate. Open/close once per round as a free action. Gates remain until destroyed, dismissed or scene end.</p><p>The token is a one-square-deep map marker for the wall; its physical height is listed above. Move/rotate the markers into the legal arrangement and resolve confinement defense rolls manually. Delete dismissed/destroyed gate tokens to release the active-gate limit.</p>{{/if}}</form>
